Subject: Derived CPMS I03B Faithful JSON Byte Ingress Source

Description: Manager-derived source preserving the faithful input boundary required before schema or serde observation. It defines exact JSON byte identity, duplicate-name refusal, token fidelity, finite resource accounting, and atomic faults as an implementation-independent contract. Formation grants no parser implementation authority.

