& [SourceNature] is manager-derived from the formed I03 contract and current implementation audit
  + this is not new verbatim user dictation
  + it preserves the next independent design question while I03A activation remains blocked

& [Purpose] release one faithful bounded JSON instance or one atomic ingress fault before any schema serde or semantic reader runs
  + exact source bytes remain the shared reader authority
  + a generic JSON Value is never the first authoritative representation because it can erase duplicate-name evidence and numeric token spelling

& [Input] is one supplied immutable byte sequence plus exact ingress limits
  + maximum input bytes is 16777216
  + empty input whitespace-only input UTF-8 BOM invalid UTF-8 and non-JSON bytes are refused
  + JSON whitespace is only space horizontal tab line feed and carriage return
  + exactly one complete JSON value followed only by JSON whitespace is required

& [UTF8] is strict and observable
  + reject overlong encodings invalid continuation bytes truncated sequences UTF-8 encoded surrogates and code points above U+10FFFF
  + report zero-based byte offset of the first known invalid byte
  + do not normalize Unicode scalar sequences

& [StringToken] retains raw byte span and decoded scalar identity
  + reject unescaped control characters and invalid escapes
  + decode quotation reverse-solidus solidus backspace form-feed line-feed carriage-return tab and four-hex-digit Unicode escapes exactly
  + combine only a valid high-surrogate and immediately following low-surrogate escape into one scalar
  + reject lone high lone low reversed or interrupted surrogate escapes
  + object member names compare by exact decoded Unicode scalar sequence
  + raw "a" and escaped "\u0061" are the same member identity and therefore duplicate in one object
  + precomposed and decomposed Unicode remain different unless their scalar sequences are exactly equal

& [NumberToken] is grammar-first and conversion-free
  + grammar is optional minus then zero or nonzero digit plus digits then optional fraction then optional exponent
  + reject leading plus leading zero missing fraction digit missing exponent digit NaN Infinity hexadecimal and locale forms
  + retain zero-based span sign integer fraction exponent markers signs digits and exact raw bytes
  + do not convert to f64 or use a floating representation as the ingress oracle
  + maximum numeric token bytes is 4096 and limit refusal occurs before unbounded accumulation

& [LiteralToken] accepts only exact lowercase true false and null

& [ContainerDepth] is exact
  + root scalar depth is 0
  + entering a root array or object establishes container depth 1
  + every nested array or object increments by one
  + maximum container depth is 128 inclusive and an attempted depth 129 is refused before descending

& [ObjectIdentity] is local to each object
  + maintain a bounded deterministic set of decoded member names per open object
  + duplicate comparison occurs before the second member value is parsed or released
  + duplicate fault retains the enclosing path decoded member name first key offset and second key offset
  + member ordering is preserved by the original bytes but never changes duplicate identity

& [Path] is a bounded logical location
  + member segments contain decoded exact names and array segments contain zero-based indexes
  + maximum path segments equals maximum container depth
  + path rendering uses RFC 6901 escaping for human and machine comparison but the structured segment list is authoritative
  + malformed structure reports the deepest fully known path and exact byte offset without inventing a missing segment

& [ResourceAccounting] is checked and aggregate over the complete value
  + input bytes maximum 16777216
  + container depth maximum 128
  + aggregate object members maximum 65536
  + aggregate array items maximum 65536
  + aggregate scalar values maximum 131072
  + each decoded member name maximum 4096 UTF-8 bytes
  + numeric token maximum 4096 source bytes
  + path segments maximum 128
  + every increment uses checked arithmetic and attempted overflow is an internal fault

& [AcceptedInstance] retains
  + profile and limits identity
  + exact original byte sequence without rewriting
  + SHA256 digest of those bytes
  + root lexical kind
  + byte length maximum depth object member array item scalar and token accounts
  + ordered number token observations with exact spans
  + proof that UTF-8 grammar single-value duplicate and every resource gate passed
  + no serde_json Value validator object typed Rust form or semantic disposition

& [Fault] is atomic stable and bounded
  + invalid_utf8 forbidden_bom empty_input malformed_json trailing_data duplicate_key limit_exceeded and internal_fault are distinct codes
  + every fault carries stage code byte offset known path and bounded explanation
  + duplicate_key carries decoded name and first and second offsets
  + limit_exceeded carries limit kind maximum and attempted observed value
  + malformed_json carries stable grammar class rather than parser display text
  + diagnostics are limited to 1024 characters
  + no partial instance token list object value or pass is returned with a fault

& [ImplementationCandidate] is one deterministic nonrecursive byte scanner with an explicit bounded frame stack
  + object frame states distinguish key colon value comma and end
  + array frame states distinguish value comma and end
  + scanner indexes original bytes and copies only bounded decoded member names paths and numeric metadata
  + BTreeSet or BTreeMap semantics provide deterministic member-name identity without randomized iteration evidence
  + sha256_bytes from cantor_core computes exact input digest

& [SourceTouchCandidate] is future and unsigned
  + add crates/cantor_procedure_tool/src/json_ingress.rs
  + expose only closed ingress forms and scan_faithful_json from crates/cantor_procedure_tool/src/lib.rs
  + add crates/cantor_procedure_tool/tests/json_ingress.rs
  + no Cargo dependency lock schema document CLI MCP service ecosystem provider model or effect file touch

& [ProofFamilies] include
  + every JSON root scalar array and object positive
  + all whitespace positions and trailing whitespace
  + malformed literals strings escapes surrogates numbers separators and endings
  + raw escaped and nested duplicate member names
  + below at and above every finite limit
  + exact path offset account digest token and deterministic repeat
  + full default debug release quality audit evidence and diff gates after future activation

& [Dependency] is strict
  + formation may proceed while I03A is blocked because this contract is validator independent
  + implementation requires a separately reviewed I03B activation and the dependency chain defined by the I03 implementation plan
  + no later validator or serde reader may weaken ingress refusal

& [Delineation] is exact
  - never: schema validation typed serde semantic evaluation authority admission compatibility classification provider model service persistence network external effect production hardware FPGA or general-purpose JSON transformation

& [PresentDisposition] is source_preserved_formation_only_no_parser_authority
